        "value": "Anxious Resident",
        "text": "I-It's none of your business!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident",
        "text": "Nemos? You stayed behind? I thought all the Dublinners left the city!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nemos",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident",
        "text": "Don't tell me you're one of those living statues now, who refuse to move or talk?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nemos",
        "text": "I might be soon. Why did you bring them up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident",
        "text": "Samhain begins tonight. So I went through the houses of the missing people, and found plenty of good stuff for the party tonight!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nemos",
        "text": "...Samhain? Party?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident",
        "text": "About Culann\u2014well, he was already on his last legs by then, and I didn't really..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident",
        "text": "Let's not talk about that! Look at all this stuff! It'll be a night to remember!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The woman shows Nemos her bag, revealing a bottle of curded cystymilk, a few long-since-sprouted potatoes, and several bare bones."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident",
        "text": "Just wait for me, Nemos, Culann... we'll have a fantastic Samhain..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only when the woman has already disappeared around a corner does Nemos remember who she is: a villager who once lived on the outskirts of Na Saoirs\u00ed."
    },
    {
        "text": "Two years ago, the Victorians took her father away while investigating Dublinn. The autumn harvest had just ended, and she had been preparing to celebrate the harvest festival."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "59_g5_remains_outside",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What Loughshinny hears about the situation in the city exceeds her wildest imagination."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny",
        "text": "I must go back. Now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brigid",
        "text": "Wait for me. I'll come with once I've delivered these folks to the wakemen."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny",
        "text": "Are you sure about this, Brigid?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny",
        "text": "It's dangerous in the city. If I fail... there may be no survivors."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brigid",
        "text": "True, but I still gotta go."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny",
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brigid",
        "text": "Because it wasn't like this before."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brigid",
        "text": "The cityfolk never had much to spare, but they always had a cup of water for me when I delivered their letters."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brigid",
        "text": "They didn't see me as one of their own, but didn't walk away with a sneer when I told them nomad legends either. They listened."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brigid",
        "text": "And they <i>definitely</i> didn't bite, claw, and punch at people like they do these days. Like the walking dead straight from a story."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brigid",
        "text": "Who will the nomads deliver letters for, if the city dies for real?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
