        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_snowconutryinside",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "'Fates are often alike, but always differ where it matters most.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "What a wonderful tagline for the cover of the book. Surely this one is destined for the best-seller charts."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Assuming, of course, that you are ever able to finish the story."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "I've never intended to profit off it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Oh, you will. If not in money, then in fame."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "The basis of the story, where it happened... There are more than enough reasons this isn't my story to tell."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "Besides, what happens next?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "That's what I wanted to ask. Did Loughshinny go back?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "From this point on, what I've seen, what I believe, and what I've said all contradict one another. Which is why I've lost sight of the ending."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "Feel free to take up the challenge, if you're up to it. Give this dance between the dragon and her reflection whatever ending you please."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Oh? Is it all the same if I tell it myself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "Of course, ma'am. As you will it\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The writer raises his mug, which is almost empty now, and toasts the woman before him."
    },
    {
        "text": "Once again, he swallows the bitter brew, half-expecting the sweet aftertaste that he knows will never come."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Did I spook you? You got so polite all of a sudden. It makes me feel impertinent for even pressing the question."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "No. But I must make it abundantly clear that everything we have discussed until now is no more than idle chatter. You understand, don't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The woman sits straight and does not say a word. The writer can only attempt to guess whether she is still smiling through the shadows."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "Well? What are you waiting for? I've nearly finished my drink."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "I've fallen into the same conundrum as you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "If this is as far as both your references and your imagination go, how could <i>I</i> possibly put the red dragon's ultimate fate to paper?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "I've already said all I'm able to. I refuse to give this story an entirely fictional end, one that not even I could believe in. Even if the alternative is that there is no ending."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "If you don't have an answer either, then no need to waste your time here. Leave while it's still early."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Is this because you do not remember, do not understand, or is it because you wish you never knew, never understood?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "\u2014What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "What are you getting at?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "You've never 'lost sight of the ending.' It would be more appropriate to say that your eyes have become clouded by too many 'creative liberties'. Shall I recount them for you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Treasures leading people into the darkness."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Culann dragging the statue to the square by himself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "And virtually everything related to the dark mist in the woods: from the rejection of Brigid, to the food carts returning to the city on their own, to Loughshinny becoming lost in the woods, to The Brigadier and Eblana's meeting in the city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "If these 'creative liberties' have created the contradictions in your mind, then it is my responsibility to set them on a path towards the ending."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Shall I supplement the story with my own observations?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Writer",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "I'll take that as a yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman",
        "text": "Perhaps they will lead you to a conclusion you can be satisfied with."
    },
